   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "In a future version, you&#39;ll be able to use a bare row_number():\r<br>\r<br> x %.% group_by(b) %.% filter(row_number() &lt;= 10)\r<br>\r<br>(that will be quite a bit faster)\r<br>\r<br>Hadley\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "\r<br>On Thu, Mar 6, 2014 at 9:26 PM, Victor Kryukov &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">victor....@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:\r<br>&gt; Hi Julien,\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; You will need window functions, described here:\r<br>&gt; <a href=\"http://cran.at.r-project.org/web/packages/dplyr/vignettes/window-functions.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.at.r-project.org/web/packages/dplyr/vignettes/window-functions.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792358174652000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1xGS-kPrTdTW9YRcmjfKsg\">http://cran.at.r-project.org/web/packages/dplyr/vignettes/window-functions.html</a>,\r<br>&gt; and then function you need is called row_number.\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; x &lt;- tbl_df(data.frame(a = rep(1:500), b = rep(letters[1:5], 100))) %.%\r<br>&gt;&gt; arrange(b)\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; x\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; Source: local data frame [500 x 2]\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;     a b\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 1   1 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 2   6 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 3  11 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 4  16 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 5  21 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 6  26 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 7  31 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 8  36 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 9  41 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 10 46 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; .. .. .\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; x %.% group_by(b) %.% filter(row_number(a) &lt;= 10)\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; Source: local data frame [50 x 2]\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; Groups: b\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;     a b\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 1   1 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 2   6 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 3  11 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 4  16 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 5  21 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 6  26 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 7  31 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 8  36 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 9  41 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 10 46 a\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 11  2 b\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 12  7 b\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 13 12 b\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 14 17 b\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 15 22 b\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 16 27 b\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 17 32 b\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&